# Match Flow and Scoring

Status: NOT_STARTED
Milestone: M2 Vertical slice
Dependencies: `02_DOMAIN_RULES.todo`, `04_TERRITORY_PAINTING.todo`, pressure decision in `15_PRODUCT_DECISIONS.todo`

## Purpose

Deliver a complete match from start through result and rematch with explainable scoring.

## Tasks

- [ ] Implement match bootstrap.
- [ ] Implement countdown and active phase.
- [ ] Implement timer.
- [ ] Implement selected pressure mechanism.
- [ ] Implement active-arena coverage calculation.
- [ ] Implement bank display data.
- [ ] Implement explicit tie behavior.
- [ ] Implement result snapshot.
- [ ] Implement reset and rematch.
- [ ] Emit phase and result events.
- [ ] Add ten-match automated smoke scenario.
- [ ] Test zero ownership, ties, reset, and completion.

## Acceptance criteria

- [ ] Ten consecutive matches complete without manual repair.
- [ ] Result matches authoritative territory state.
- [ ] Tie and zero-owner behavior is explicit.
- [ ] Pressure is telegraphed and symmetric.
- [ ] Rematch returns to a clean state.
- [ ] Result data explains decisive territory and reactions.

